{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Background</strong>: &quot;Escape from the Forest&quot; tells the story of a little boy who gets lost in a fantastical forest. You will play as this little boy, seeking the help of other people in the forest and fighting against the monsters within it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Genre</strong>: This game is a 2D pixel-style RPG. You will control the little boy to explore in this 2D forest and find a way to escape from it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gameplay</strong>: Defeat the monsters in the forest, help NPCs complete corresponding tasks, make different choices and attempts to achieve different endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Endings</strong>: This game has multiple endings. Different decisions made by players will affect the game endings. <u>We encourage players to try multiple times to discover different endings.</u></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3649480?t=1744337744","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3649480?t=1744337744","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649480/e5979942003155a4087b5ade8e326c8fbcded260/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744337744","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649480/e5979942003155a4087b5ade8e326c8fbcded260/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744337744","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Background</strong>: &quot;Escape from the Forest&quot; tells the story of a little boy who gets lost in a fantastical forest. You will play as this little boy, seeking the help of other people in the forest and fighting against the monsters within it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Genre</strong>: This game is a 2D pixel-style RPG. You will control the little boy to explore in this 2D forest and find a way to escape from it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gameplay</strong>: Defeat the monsters in the forest, help NPCs complete corresponding tasks, make different choices and attempts to achieve different endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Endings</strong>: This game has multiple endings. Different decisions made by players will affect the game endings. <u>We encourage players to try multiple times to discover different endings.</u></p>","developers":["oldpoplar"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649480/72f485707a3cc3ae344a6044f3078510225a892d/header.jpg?t=1744337744","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257123605,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123605/movie480.mp4?t=1744334280","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123605/movie_max.mp4?t=1744334280"},"name":"\u5ba3\u4f20\u7247","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257123605/28e6283fcc4ab1390ad9a62c6f0b47b740eda46d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744334280","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123605/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744334280","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123605/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744334280"}}],"name":"Escape from the Forest","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"